2" :question/math-academy-id "q-39435" :question/problem "Given that $‖3u+v‖=18$ and $‖u‖=5$, find the smallest possible value of $‖v‖.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the triangle inequality, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖3u+v‖ & \\le 3‖u‖+‖v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖3u+v‖ & \\le 3‖u‖+‖v‖ \\\\ 18 & \\le 3\\cdot 5+‖v‖ \\\\ 18 & \\le 15+‖v‖ \\\\ 3 & \\le ‖v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖v‖$ is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-39435/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae3aec8-4d20-5467-9ced-2a9c1bda3afd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-39435"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189/selection/05402db46107d70ece210f0bd5e24b332ae4f43bd474d592035c3e3c92625629" :answer/id #uuid "997f3674-2a22-5bd1-bc30-2078e0d9a5bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "e6c52225-5dde-5b33-a3ac-d4e1a8913364" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "14a6a064-8df6-567c-a643-975805f8144a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "72ea6fbc-62cc-544e-86d6-2188468eb56b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189/selection/73eeaf3fae024b54005d89a5185040ad67cf4b6c72d401d6ad32bf0e79c13de9" :answer/id #uuid "1b851475-32b8-5441-9aff-61339013e3c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "38a6ec11-d26d-52b9-ae46-f46b84595ac6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74189/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-74189/selection/05402db46107d70ece210f0bd5e24b332ae4f43bd474d592035c3e3c92625629" "q-74189/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-74189/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-74189/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-74189/selection/73eeaf3fae024b54005d89a5185040ad67cf4b6c72d401d6ad32bf0e79c13de9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74189" :question/id #uuid "f534cec9-9116-54fb-a3f5-d850faa1c4c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-74189" :question/problem "Let the vectors $v$ and $w$ be orthogonal. \nIf $|u\\cdot v{|}^{2}+5‖v+w{‖}^{2}=101$ and $‖u‖=‖w‖=2$, then what is the minimum possible value of $‖v‖?$" :question/worked-solution "First, using the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality, simplifying, and substituting in the given information, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}101 & ={|u\\cdot v|}^{2}+5‖v+w{‖}^{2} \\\\  & \\le {‖u{‖}^{2}\\cdot ‖v‖}^{2}+5‖v+w{‖}^{2} \\\\  & ={2}^{2}\\cdot ‖v{‖}^{2}+5‖v+w{‖}^{2} \\\\  & =4‖v{‖}^{2}+5‖v+w{‖}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $v⊥w$, using the Pythagorean theorem, simplifying, and substituting in the given information, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4‖v{‖}^{2}+5‖v+w{‖}^{2} & =4‖v{‖}^{2}+5(‖v{‖}^{2}+‖w{‖}^{2}) \\\\  & =4‖v{‖}^{2}+5(‖v{‖}^{2}+{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =9‖v{‖}^{2}+20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCombining the two steps above, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}101 & \\le 9‖v‖+20 \\\\ 81 & \\le 9‖v{‖}^{2} \\\\ 9 & \\le ‖v{‖}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $9\\le ‖v{‖}^{2}$ implies that $3\\le ‖v‖.$ Notice that we disregard the negative solutions since the norm can't be negative.\n\nTherefore, the minimum possible value of $‖v‖$ is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-74189/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2391612a-ee27-5cb2-a194-9b51e6fec1e1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74189"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
